  "prefLabel": "Rev 308.02 Confidentiality of Department Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 308.02 Confidentiality of Department Records.\n\n(a) All business profits tax returns and information shall be confidential pursuant to Rev 2903.02.\n\n(b) A power of attorney shall be submitted to the department prior to, or in conjunction with, a request for information or any discussion with the department regarding the business organization or the organization's business affairs.\n\nSource. #2012, eff 5-5-82; ss by #2722, eff 5-23-84; ss by #4192, eff 12-23-86; ss by #5490, eff 10-19-92; ss by #6853, eff 9-23-98; ss by #8709, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10758, eff 1-16-15; ss by #14231, eff 4-3-25, EXPIRES 4-3-35",
